# Covers secrets, OS noise, editor noise and build output. The stack was chosen on
# 2026-09-10 (docs/requirements.md 1.6), so the Node entries below are now warranted;
# they were deliberately absent before that.

# Local working context, deliberately untracked. Holds machine specific environment
# details and personal notes that have no place in a public repository. The engineering
# invariants that contributors actually need are stated in README.md instead.
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md

# Study notes and syntheses of course material. Untracked on purpose: they summarise
# UCL course slides and a commercial textbook, so they stay out of a public repository.
# Extracted source text also lands here and must never be committed.
study/

# Secrets and local configuration. NFR-S3: no secret is ever committed.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
secrets/

# OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*~

# Editor and tooling
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# Node, TypeScript and build output. Nothing generated is committed.
node_modules/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo
.eslintcache
coverage/

# Prisma generated client
prisma/generated/
prisma/migrations/dev.db*

# Logs and local scratch
*.log
tmp/
.cache/
